        "book": "Joshua",
        "chapter": 17,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "But the mountain shall be thine; for it is a wood, and thou shalt cut it down: and the outgoings of it shall be thine: for thou shalt drive out the Canaanites, though they have iron chariots, and though they be strong.",
